00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:02,660
It's okay. It's fine.
沒關係。沒關係。

364
00:17:02,740 --> 00:17:03,060
Carl!
卡爾！

365
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:06,840
Oh.
哦。

366
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,400
Wow. Is that Michelle?
哇。那是米歇爾嗎？

367
00:17:22,820 --> 00:17:23,080
Yep.
是的。

368
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,820
I've not seen her since high school graduation.
高中畢業後我就沒見過她。

369
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:28,480
Oh, my God. That night, she got so drunk.
我的天啊。那天晚上，她喝得醉醺醺的。

370
00:17:32,020 --> 00:17:32,500
Emotional.
情緒化。

371
00:17:33,300 --> 00:17:34,800
You know, she's having another baby.
你知道，她又要生一個孩子了。

372
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,300
I thought you just had one.
我以為你只有一個。

373
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:37,920
No, no.
不，不。

374
00:17:38,220 --> 00:17:39,700
Henry's almost two,
亨利快兩歲了，

375
00:17:40,460 --> 00:17:42,040
and he's talking and everything.
他正在說話等等。

376
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:42,940
Here.
這裡。

377
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:44,080
Aw.
噢。

378
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:46,420
You know, the other day, he told me he liked you.
你知道嗎，有一天，他告訴我他喜歡你。

379
00:17:46,420 --> 00:17:48,040
He liked me better than his other grandpa.
他比他的另一個爺爺更喜歡我。

380
00:17:48,860 --> 00:17:51,160
Now, in all fairness, his other grandpa's a drunk, but still.
現在，平心而論，他的另一個爺爺雖然喝醉了，但仍然如此。

381
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:55,680
Whoa. You're a grandpa.
哇哦。你是個爺爺了。

382
00:17:59,360 --> 00:17:59,920
Yeah.
是的。

383
00:18:05,780 --> 00:18:07,020
Are we nuts here?
我們瘋了嗎？

384
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:09,720
I don't know. Maybe.
我不知道。或許。

385
00:18:10,060 --> 00:18:14,180
I mean, I'm dating a man whose pool I once peed in.
我的意思是，我正在和一個男人約會，我曾經在他的泳池裡撒過尿。

386
00:18:15,420 --> 00:18:17,120
I didn't need to know that.
我不需要知道這一點。

387
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:20,440
I guess 21 years is a lot.
我想21年已經很多了。

388
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:25,440
I mean, hell, I'm a whole person who can drink older than you.
我的意思是，見鬼，我是一個比你還老的人還能喝酒。

389
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:28,260
Yeah.
是的。

390
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:33,940
So...
所以...

391
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:38,900
So maybe we should just...
所以也許我們應該...

392
00:18:38,900 --> 00:18:39,080
Yeah.
是的。

393
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:41,580
Yeah.
是的。

394
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:43,420
Maybe...
也許...

395
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,120
Wow.
哇。

396
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:52,800
This really sucks.
這真的很糟糕。

397
00:18:53,140 --> 00:18:54,360
Yeah, it sure does.
是的，確實如此。

398
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:57,840
Ah.
啊。

399
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:15,440
Well, we don't really have to decide anything right now, do we?
好吧，我們現在真的不需要做任何決定，不是嗎？

400
00:19:16,600 --> 00:19:18,380
No, there's no rush or anything.
不，沒有什麼急事。

401
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:21,340
Hey, a pizza delivery.
嘿，披薩外帶。

402
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:22,840
Oh, I'm gonna kill those guys.
哦，我要殺了那些傢伙。

403
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:27,100
Rach?
瑞秋？

404
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:27,480
Oh.
哦。

405
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:28,920
I'm done.
我受夠了。

406
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:33,080
Yeah, well, you know what? So is Sorrentino's.
是的，好吧，你知道嗎？索倫蒂諾的也是如此。

407
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,960
Okay, I'm sorry. Let's, uh...
好吧，對不起。讓我們，呃...

408
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,260
Why don't we find someplace else?
我們為什麼不找別的地方呢？

409
00:19:37,460 --> 00:19:39,740
No, you know what? It's late. Everything's gonna be closed.
不，你知道嗎？現在已經太晚了。一切都將關閉。

410
00:19:39,820 --> 00:19:40,920
Why don't we just do it another night?
我們為什麼不改個晚上再做呢？

411
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,480
No, no, we won't.
不，不，我們不會。

412
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:43,340
We won't?
我們不會嗎？

413
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:45,300
Come on.
快點。

414
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:47,920
Okay, that's dead, right?
好吧，那已經死了，對吧？

415
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:52,360
What is this? What are you doing?
這是什麼？你在幹什麼？

416
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:54,400
Shh! Do you want cran-apple or cran-grape?
噓！您想要蔓越莓蘋果還是蔓越莓葡萄？

417
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:55,400
Grape.
葡萄。

418
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:00,360
Okay, now...
好吧，現在...

419
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:00,680
Sit.
坐。

420
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:03,400
Okay.
好的。

421
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:07,640
Oh, God!
哦，上帝！

422
00:20:09,460 --> 00:20:11,720
Billions of years ago...
數十億年前...

423
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,380
I'm sorry.
對不起。

424
00:20:20,100 --> 00:20:22,280
So, what are we looking at?
那麼，我們在看什麼？

425
00:20:23,080 --> 00:20:27,760
Well, you see that little cluster of stars next to the big one?
嗯，你看到大星團旁邊的小星團了嗎？

426
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:30,540
That is Ursa Major.
那就是大熊座。

427
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:31,680
Really?
真的嗎？

428
00:20:32,020 --> 00:20:33,200
No idea. Could be.
不知道。可能是。

429
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:39,220
Listen, I'm sorry I had to work tonight.
聽著，很抱歉我今晚必須工作。

430
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:41,280
No, that's okay.
不，沒關係。

431
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:43,360
You were worth the wait.
你值得等待。

432
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:44,300
Oh.
哦。

433
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:46,860
And I don't just mean tonight.
我指的不僅僅是今晚。

434
00:20:54,840 --> 00:20:55,320
Whoa.
哇哦。

435
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:58,020
You're not laughing.
你沒有笑。

436
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,680
This time it's not so funny.
這次可沒那麼好笑了。

437
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:03,680
I knew somebody like you.
我認識像你這樣的人。

438
00:21:06,520 --> 00:21:11,880
No, I don't want to fall in love.
不，我不想談戀愛。

439
00:21:15,340 --> 00:21:17,000
No, I don't want to fall in love.
不，我不想談戀愛。

440
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:21,300
Okay, listen to that, listen to that.
好吧，聽聽這個，聽聽這個。

441
00:21:34,220 --> 00:21:35,220
Oh, God!
哦，上帝！

442
00:21:35,980 --> 00:21:37,880
Oh, honey.
哦，親愛的。

443
00:21:38,860 --> 00:21:40,100
Oh, that's okay.
哦，沒關係。

444
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:41,780
What?
什麼？

445
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:45,880
Oh, no, you just rolled over the juice box.
哦，不，你剛剛滾翻了果汁盒。

446
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:55,660
Oh, thank God.
哦，感謝上帝。

447
00:22:05,220 --> 00:22:12,720
I don't want to fall in love with you.
我不想愛上你。

448
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:25,000
Hi.
你好。

449
00:22:26,340 --> 00:22:27,320
Hey, you.
嘿，你。

450
00:22:33,340 --> 00:22:36,160
I can't believe I'm waking up next to you.
我不敢相信我在你身邊醒來。

451
00:22:37,260 --> 00:22:39,160
I know, it is pretty unbelievable.
我知道，這太令人難以置信了。

452
00:22:41,880 --> 00:22:43,060
We're not alone.
我們並不孤單。

453
00:23:08,260 --> 00:23:08,920
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

454
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:13,320
Is that the fire alarm?
那是火警警報嗎？

455
00:23:14,380 --> 00:23:14,900
Yeah.
是的。

456
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:21,080
Well, that's not warm yet. We still have time.
嗯，還沒熱。我們還有時間。

457
00:23:23,120 --> 00:23:23,640
Cool.
涼爽的。

458
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:25,160
Yeah, yeah, cool.
是啊是啊，酷極了

